# ksuid — K-Sortable Unique ID generator (CLI)

Used by bash scripts and PHP (via shell_exec) to generate 27-char base62 IDs for the database (e.g. globals.pkey instance id, and id columns in tenant tables).

- **Package:** pbx3 Depends on the Debian/Ubuntu package **ksuid** (from segmentio/ksuid). The binary is on PATH (`/usr/bin/ksuid`).
- **This directory:** Optional Go source for local build if the system package is not available. From here: `go build -o ../../opt/pbx3/bin/ksuid .` (requires Go).
- **Library:** [github.com/segmentio/ksuid](https://github.com/segmentio/ksuid)

PHP uses `tuupola/ksuid` (Composer) in the API; the system ksuid CLI is for bash and for PHP utilities (dumper.php, dumpInstances.php).
